Package: mecCox
Title: Prognostic Balance for ATT-Weighted Cox Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Se Yoon", "Lee", email = "seyoonlee.stat.math@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Fits marginal Cox comparisons with external controls. Provides an
    unweighted reference, inverse-probability weighting for the average
    treatment effect in the treated (ATT), and machine-learning-assisted
    entropy calibration of the external-control weights. Cross-fitted
    prognostic survival predictions can enter the calibration constraints.
    Includes diagnostics for weight stability and predicted-risk balance.
